WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 38

01:39.090 --> 01:41.960
Your Excellency, it's not right.

01:43.330 --> 01:44.600
What's wrong?

01:47.900 --> 01:49.770
They're watching us outside.

01:49.980 --> 01:50.620
According to years of experience

01:50.620 --> 01:52.240
in tracking and sneaking,

01:52.260 --> 01:53.670
I can't be wrong.

01:53.690 --> 01:55.750
It's the Shangjing Town of Beiqi.

01:55.770 --> 01:56.900
It's their job

01:56.900 --> 01:58.630
to watch us.

01:58.650 --> 01:59.560
Your Excellency,

01:59.580 --> 02:01.050
Guo Baokun was followed

02:01.050 --> 02:02.520
when he left just now.

02:02.540 --> 02:04.010
I'm afraid

02:04.010 --> 02:05.600
Guo Baokun is exposed.

02:06.900 --> 02:08.450
Of course he is.

02:09.620 --> 02:11.370
He jumped off the cart in public

02:11.370 --> 02:13.600
and checked into an inn after wandering about the streets.

02:13.620 --> 02:15.160
If he hadn't been found out,

02:15.180 --> 02:16.420
His Excellency Shen and the Embroidered Uniform Guards would be punished

02:16.420 --> 02:17.840
for their failure in duty.

02:17.930 --> 02:20.040
Your Excellency, did you expect

02:20.060 --> 02:21.450
Guo Baokun would fail to hide himself?

02:22.450 --> 02:24.470
I asked him to go out on purpose

02:24.490 --> 02:25.680
to distract Shen Zhong.

02:25.700 --> 02:28.470
You want to use him

02:28.490 --> 02:30.120
to divert attention from us.

02:40.140 --> 02:41.760
Prison.

02:42.060 --> 02:43.920
The Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison.

02:44.090 --> 02:45.970
The Embroidered Uniform Guards.

02:46.210 --> 02:47.810
The Embroidered Uniform...

02:57.060 --> 02:59.200
What can I do for you?

02:59.260 --> 03:00.980
Can you tell me

03:00.980 --> 03:02.370
where the Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison is?

03:03.260 --> 03:04.290
Here is a pharmacy.

03:04.290 --> 03:05.930
Are you feeling under the weather?

03:05.930 --> 03:07.450
No. I'm well.

03:07.450 --> 03:08.370
Can you tell me

03:08.370 --> 03:10.120
where the Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison is?

03:10.140 --> 03:11.420
Prison. Prison.

03:11.420 --> 03:12.890
A building where people are kept as a punishment.

03:14.290 --> 03:16.270
This medicine helps reduce hysteria.

03:16.290 --> 03:18.160
Sir, you can have it for free.

03:18.180 --> 03:19.730
Take it home.

03:21.540 --> 03:22.820
Did he ask people on the streets

03:22.820 --> 03:23.960
about the Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison?

03:23.980 --> 03:26.270
Yes. He asked everyone he met.

03:26.290 --> 03:27.880
He's really rampant.

03:27.900 --> 03:29.120
But don't worry.

03:29.140 --> 03:30.880
The Embroidered Uniform Guards is well-known.

03:30.900 --> 03:32.350
Nobody answered him.

03:32.370 --> 03:33.640
He was ignored.

03:34.090 --> 03:35.570
I didn't expect Fan Xian would

03:35.570 --> 03:37.840
let such a guy...

03:37.900 --> 03:40.250
Your Excellency.

03:44.650 --> 03:46.570
Can you tell me

03:46.570 --> 03:47.680
where the Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison is?

03:47.700 --> 03:49.550
No idea.

03:49.570 --> 03:50.760
No idea.

03:51.700 --> 03:53.060
Can you tell me where the Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison is?

03:53.060 --> 03:54.890
I don't know.

03:55.420 --> 03:56.430
Can you tell me

03:56.450 --> 03:58.090
where the Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison is?

03:58.090 --> 03:59.260
No idea.

03:59.260 --> 04:01.000
Isn't he afraid of death?

04:02.340 --> 04:03.210
Do you know

04:03.210 --> 04:04.010
where the Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison is?

04:04.010 --> 04:05.090
No. No. I don't.

04:05.090 --> 04:06.530
No idea. No idea.

04:07.570 --> 04:08.620
Does anyone know

04:08.620 --> 04:10.210
where the Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison is?

04:10.210 --> 04:11.700
He must be insane.

04:11.700 --> 04:13.400
He must want to die.

04:19.890 --> 04:23.130
Can you tell me where the Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison is?

04:27.650 --> 04:29.520
Go that way and pass through three intersections.

04:29.540 --> 04:31.530
Then turn west. You'll find it.

04:31.610 --> 04:33.200
Thank you.

04:40.820 --> 04:42.920
Your Excellency, shall we arrest him?

04:43.700 --> 04:44.860
The Investigator's Office

04:44.860 --> 04:46.920
couldn't send such a crap here.

04:48.770 --> 04:49.740
Let's go to the inn.

04:49.740 --> 04:51.810
Got it. Go to the inn.

05:15.460 --> 05:16.440
Your Excellency,

05:16.460 --> 05:18.150
our scouts are just around.

05:18.170 --> 05:20.370
They didn't find Fan Xian going out.

05:21.460 --> 05:22.640
Search the room!

05:25.540 --> 05:27.250
What are you doing?

05:29.890 --> 05:30.860
Do you even want to

05:30.860 --> 05:32.530
search under bed?

05:33.330 --> 05:35.090
Your Excellency,

05:35.090 --> 05:37.010
did they vanish into thin air?

05:53.300 --> 05:55.240
It fell off from above.

05:55.260 --> 05:56.810
They left from the roof?

05:57.650 --> 05:58.610
Dispatch my orders

05:58.610 --> 05:59.650
to search for them

05:59.650 --> 06:01.350
in the surroundings radiating from the inn.

06:01.370 --> 06:03.130
Avoid catching people's eyes.

06:03.860 --> 06:05.040
Got it.

06:24.460 --> 06:26.160
It's such a lame trick.

06:26.740 --> 06:27.700
The smarter a person is,

06:27.700 --> 06:29.070
the more liable he's to be taken in.

06:29.090 --> 06:30.470
Any inexperienced guy

06:30.490 --> 06:31.090
would choose to

06:31.090 --> 06:33.160
search under bed first.

06:34.890 --> 06:37.160
Only a smart guy like Shen Zhong

06:38.300 --> 06:40.250
would think too much

06:40.930 --> 06:42.290
after noticing some details.

06:46.050 --> 06:48.310
Search carefully. Don't be too worried.

06:48.330 --> 06:50.720
Even if we fail to find them for a while,

06:50.820 --> 06:52.020
it'll be difficult for them

06:52.020 --> 06:53.280
to do anything big without support.

06:53.300 --> 06:54.910
Also keep watch on that guy who asked about the prison,

06:54.930 --> 06:55.740
in case

06:55.740 --> 06:56.960
Fan Xian does exactly the opposite

06:56.980 --> 06:59.160
and plays dumb to make trouble.

06:59.820 --> 07:01.460
You're really thoughtful.

07:01.460 --> 07:02.850
It's admiring.

07:07.210 --> 07:08.480
Your Excellency,

07:08.820 --> 07:10.960
we shook them off for the time being.

07:10.980 --> 07:13.310
But where should we start to find him?

07:13.330 --> 07:15.010
What shall we do next?

07:15.260 --> 07:16.400
Let's go.

07:16.420 --> 07:17.470
What are we going to do?

07:17.490 --> 07:18.880
To see someone.

07:21.260 --> 07:23.130
How did you know this place?

07:30.090 --> 07:31.530
Who wrote it?

07:31.820 --> 07:33.800
Does anyone in this imperial palace

07:33.820 --> 07:35.720
work for the Investigator's Office?

07:35.740 --> 07:36.800
On the way.

07:36.820 --> 07:37.330
Huh?

07:37.330 --> 07:38.850
Which way?

07:39.860 --> 07:41.260
Why did I keep the flag alone

07:41.260 --> 07:42.640
to provoke them?

07:43.490 --> 07:45.200
To gain face.

07:45.300 --> 07:46.630
It makes sense,

07:46.650 --> 07:48.190
but what's more important,

07:48.210 --> 07:49.460
I came to Beiqi

07:49.460 --> 07:50.960
to reactivate the spy network,

07:50.980 --> 07:52.770
but secret agents are in hiding,

07:52.770 --> 07:54.630
and I know nothing about their whereabouts.

07:54.650 --> 07:56.240
I'd rather let them know I'm here

07:56.260 --> 07:57.170
than look for them

07:57.170 --> 07:58.350
one by one.

07:58.370 --> 08:00.240
That's why you decided to make a big deal out of it

08:00.260 --> 08:01.570
and catch people's eyes.

08:02.890 --> 08:04.030
I see

08:04.050 --> 08:06.560
why we're here with the banner of the border troops.

08:06.580 --> 08:07.590
That is,

08:07.610 --> 08:08.610
even if Shen Zhong

08:08.610 --> 08:10.280
didn't make things difficult for us,

08:10.300 --> 08:11.610
you've decided to

08:11.610 --> 08:12.910
make trouble.

08:12.930 --> 08:14.400
When you can't find people you need in thick fog,

08:14.420 --> 08:16.600
make yourself a beacon to attract them.

08:16.820 --> 08:18.400
Who gave you the address?

08:18.420 --> 08:20.320
Why didn't I find it?

08:33.340 --> 08:35.040
He Daoren?

08:51.730 --> 08:52.700
I've found out

08:52.700 --> 08:54.040
where the Embroidered Uniform Guards' prison is.

09:05.610 --> 09:08.000
You have strong vitality Qi, but you're not skilled enough.

09:08.020 --> 09:10.600
I can kill you if we fight now.

09:13.820 --> 09:15.250
Try it.

09:17.020 --> 09:18.800
Chen Pingping asked me

09:18.820 --> 09:20.920
to give you a hand when you're in Shangjing.

09:21.700 --> 09:23.690
How will you prove your identity?

09:37.700 --> 09:39.440
It is the stamp of the Investigator's Office.

09:39.460 --> 09:41.390
The wood pattern is specially made.

09:41.410 --> 09:43.770
An outsider couldn't figure it out.

09:47.170 --> 09:48.510
Keep it.

09:48.530 --> 09:49.700
I only promised Chen Pingping

09:49.700 --> 09:50.680
that I'd help you this time.

09:50.700 --> 09:52.890
It's of no use to me in the future.

09:57.340 --> 09:59.270
Your disciple Cheng Jushu

09:59.290 --> 09:59.930
was killed by me.

09:59.930 --> 10:01.100
I have a lot of disciples.

10:01.100 --> 10:02.340
What would Chen Pingping do for you in return?

10:02.340 --> 10:03.510
None of your business.

10:03.530 --> 10:04.560
How will you help me?

10:04.580 --> 10:05.710
I won't take action

10:05.730 --> 10:07.080
or fight for you.

10:07.100 --> 10:08.590
I won't expose my identity rashly.

10:08.610 --> 10:10.640
I'll just convey information.

10:10.660 --> 10:11.920
About what?

10:17.050 --> 10:19.210
About the branch of Neiku in Shangjing.

10:19.660 --> 10:20.370
What do I need to do?

10:20.370 --> 10:21.700
Chen Pingping said

10:21.700 --> 10:22.780
you're going to

10:22.780 --> 10:24.030
take over Neiku.

10:24.050 --> 10:25.560
You can take the chance to look through the account book

10:25.580 --> 10:27.520
and get familiar with the branch.

10:29.460 --> 10:31.280
I'm under close watch.

10:31.660 --> 10:32.920
It doesn't matter.

10:33.260 --> 10:34.370
Both government officials and common people here

10:34.370 --> 10:35.220
know that

10:35.220 --> 10:37.150
it's the branch of Nanqing's Neiku.

10:37.170 --> 10:38.400
They all know?

10:38.660 --> 10:39.800
But it's not closed down?

10:39.820 --> 10:41.950
It's about commerce and trade. It's the source of wealth.

10:41.970 --> 10:43.640
Relevant parties all benefit from it.

10:43.660 --> 10:45.320
Nobody hates to make money.

10:45.340 --> 10:46.890
Even the Embroidered Uniform Guards let it go?

10:47.850 --> 10:48.700
It's the Embroidered Uniform Guards

10:48.700 --> 10:50.370
that does business with Neiku.

10:54.140 --> 10:55.390
Princess Royal even did business

10:55.410 --> 10:57.280
with them.

10:58.290 --> 11:00.330
Who do you work for in Shangjing?

11:00.370 --> 11:02.000
I'm a follower of the Empress Dowager.

11:02.020 --> 11:02.830
Do you know

11:02.850 --> 11:04.560
where Yan Bingyun is imprisoned?

11:04.580 --> 11:05.890
No.

11:06.140 --> 11:08.050
He was imprisoned by Shen Zhong personally.

11:08.050 --> 11:10.130
Few people know the exact location.

11:10.290 --> 11:11.050
Do you know where the other secret agents

11:11.050 --> 11:12.840
of the Investigator's Office are?

11:12.900 --> 11:14.250
No.

11:15.580 --> 11:16.930
I have to tell you something.

11:16.930 --> 11:18.780
I promised Chen Pingping I'd help you this time,

11:18.780 --> 11:19.610
but it doesn't mean

11:19.610 --> 11:21.250
I work for the Investigator's Office.

11:26.140 --> 11:27.320
Do you know

11:27.340 --> 11:28.370
the last place Yan Bingyun went

11:28.370 --> 11:29.810
before he was arrested?

11:30.050 --> 11:31.170
Well.

11:31.170 --> 11:32.520
Yes.

11:38.530 --> 11:39.530
I wonder how Head Chen

11:39.530 --> 11:41.040
managed to let

11:41.100 --> 11:43.260
the Ninth Dan swordsman of Beiqi

11:43.260 --> 11:44.920
work for him.

11:45.140 --> 11:45.970
We're pressed for time.

11:45.970 --> 11:47.320
Let's act separately.

11:47.340 --> 11:49.030
I'll go to Yan Bingyun's former residence

11:49.050 --> 11:50.440
and you go to Neiku's branch

11:50.460 --> 11:52.010
to get an account book.

11:52.220 --> 11:53.050
Do you want to

11:53.050 --> 11:54.140
find some clues

11:54.140 --> 11:55.140
at Yan Bingyun's residence?

11:55.140 --> 11:56.000
Some traces must've been left

11:56.020 --> 11:57.320
if he stayed there.

11:57.340 --> 11:58.900
We can find out some secrets

11:58.900 --> 11:59.760
from the layout of his room

11:59.780 --> 12:01.920
and arrangement of furniture.

12:02.660 --> 12:04.400
Your Excellency, be careful.

12:11.900 --> 12:12.830
Let's go there next time.

12:12.850 --> 12:13.780
Okay. Take care.

12:13.780 --> 12:15.250
See you.

12:19.850 --> 12:21.700
Boss, a cup of hot tea!

12:21.700 --> 12:23.010
Okay!

12:41.490 --> 12:43.280
I'm from the south.

13:07.610 --> 13:09.880
Since you disappeared,

13:09.900 --> 13:11.770
I've been thinking

13:11.820 --> 13:13.590
where I'd go

13:13.610 --> 13:15.210
if I were you.

13:17.460 --> 13:19.030
In the final analysis,

13:19.050 --> 13:21.210
what you want to do most

13:21.260 --> 13:23.770
is to find Yan Bingyun.

13:24.610 --> 13:26.650
Where should you go to look for him?

13:27.730 --> 13:29.240
If I were you,

13:29.260 --> 13:29.930
I'd go to

13:29.930 --> 13:31.890
where he used to live

13:32.140 --> 13:34.770
and see if there are any clues.

13:38.490 --> 13:41.570
So, I decided to wait here.

13:41.780 --> 13:44.520
As expected, you came here.

13:46.820 --> 13:48.370
Only me.

13:49.970 --> 13:51.250
You won't arrest me?

13:51.490 --> 13:53.040
It's unnecessary.

13:59.340 --> 14:01.320
The next day when Yan Bingyun was arrested,

14:01.340 --> 14:03.250
I got everything

14:03.730 --> 14:05.080
moved from this place

14:05.100 --> 14:06.960
to the Embroidered Uniform Guards

14:07.730 --> 14:09.210
and dismantled.

14:13.820 --> 14:15.560
Each and every tile on the roof

14:15.580 --> 14:17.450
has been changed.

14:18.140 --> 14:20.040
Each and every brick on the ground

14:20.170 --> 14:22.650
has been turned over.

14:23.930 --> 14:25.000
What did you find?

14:25.020 --> 14:26.480
Nothing.

14:26.700 --> 14:28.240
He hid nothing.

14:28.260 --> 14:29.770
You must've been tired to do that.

14:30.370 --> 14:32.150
It's official business.

14:32.170 --> 14:35.040
I have to try my best.

14:35.290 --> 14:38.010
Your Excellency Fan, I'll wait for you outside.

14:38.610 --> 14:40.000
Search it carefully.

14:40.020 --> 14:41.270
Take your time.

14:41.290 --> 14:43.330
I hope you can find something useful.

15:04.970 --> 15:07.890
So fast? Don't you want to search again?

15:08.490 --> 15:10.040
I don't think

15:10.290 --> 15:11.530
there would be any omissions

15:11.530 --> 15:13.040
now that you've had it searched.

15:13.730 --> 15:15.150
Your Excellency Fan,

15:15.170 --> 15:16.810
you'd better give up.

15:17.370 --> 15:18.800
Here is Shangjing.

15:18.820 --> 15:20.120
Without support,

15:20.140 --> 15:21.890
you couldn't do anything here.

15:22.490 --> 15:24.280
But I still want to have a try.

15:25.460 --> 15:27.160
Shangjing is a big city.

15:27.260 --> 15:29.490
Many people went into the depths of streets

15:29.490 --> 15:31.650
and then disappeared forever.

15:32.370 --> 15:33.890
I'm not bragging.

15:34.100 --> 15:35.640
Nobody could stop me

15:35.660 --> 15:37.770
unless he's achieved Ninth Dan.

15:43.700 --> 15:44.800
Your Excellency,

15:44.820 --> 15:46.100
after Fan Xian and Wang Qinian

15:46.100 --> 15:47.660
went back to the residence,

15:47.660 --> 15:49.770
they didn't go out any more.

15:49.820 --> 15:50.780
We've found out

15:50.780 --> 15:52.390
what Wang Qinian did earlier.

15:52.410 --> 15:54.880
He went to the branch of Nanqing's Neiku

15:54.900 --> 15:56.840
and took an account book back.

16:04.410 --> 16:05.960
Your Excellency.

16:06.900 --> 16:08.280
Please.

16:10.460 --> 16:11.760
In my opinion,

16:11.780 --> 16:14.440
Fan Xian is going to take over Neiku.

16:14.460 --> 16:15.530
They took an account book back

16:15.530 --> 16:17.890
probably to prepare for the future.

16:18.580 --> 16:20.350
He won't give up on Yan Bingyun.

16:20.370 --> 16:22.640
Don't worry. It's like searching for a needle in a haystack.

16:22.660 --> 16:24.960
We'd better be careful, just in case.

16:25.050 --> 16:26.510
Your Excellency, you can trust me.

16:26.530 --> 16:28.520
I've increased secret sentries.

16:34.370 --> 16:36.890
Fan Xian reminded me of something today.

16:37.970 --> 16:39.600
He has superb martial arts skill.

16:39.780 --> 16:41.340
We need a Ninth Dan martial arts master

16:41.340 --> 16:43.400
to keep an eye on him.

16:44.020 --> 16:46.170
There is no Ninth Dan martial arts master

16:46.170 --> 16:48.400
available in the Embroidered Uniform Guards.

16:50.850 --> 16:53.650
It's okay. We can borrow one.

16:54.140 --> 16:55.570
Huh?

16:57.410 --> 16:58.810
There he is.

17:05.620 --> 17:06.930
Mr. He.

17:09.250 --> 17:10.680
Mr. He,

17:11.100 --> 17:13.630
I asked the Empress Dowager to send you here

17:13.650 --> 17:14.530
because I hope you can

17:14.530 --> 17:15.990
keep someone under watch.

17:16.010 --> 17:16.960
Who is it?

17:16.980 --> 17:19.150
Fan Xian from Nanqing.

17:19.170 --> 17:21.030
You asked me to keep an eye on Fan Xian?

17:21.050 --> 17:23.480
I know you're overqualified,

17:23.500 --> 17:26.530
but you're the most suitable person.

17:33.650 --> 17:35.370
Shen Zhong is right.

17:35.530 --> 17:37.650
You're the most suitable person.

17:37.980 --> 17:39.650
You're lucky.

17:40.130 --> 17:41.600
It's not about luck.

17:41.740 --> 17:43.500
I said some words during the day

17:43.500 --> 17:45.200
to remind him of it on purpose.

17:45.220 --> 17:47.530
There are so many Ninth Dan martial arts masters in Shangjing.

17:47.820 --> 17:49.840
How did you know he'd come to me?

17:51.650 --> 17:53.010
There are few

17:53.010 --> 17:54.600
Ninth Dan martial arts masters here.

17:54.770 --> 17:57.440
You, Shangshan Hu and Haitang Duoduo.

17:57.460 --> 17:59.910
It couldn't be the Saintess.

17:59.930 --> 18:01.010
Shangshan Hu is anxious

18:01.010 --> 18:02.580
to take Shen Zhong by the throat.

18:02.580 --> 18:04.200
You're the only choice.

18:04.220 --> 18:05.510
Your disciple was killed by me

18:05.530 --> 18:07.170
and both of you work for the Empress Dowager of Beiqi.

18:07.170 --> 18:08.800
Of course he'd turn to you.

18:13.460 --> 18:15.560
Did you get the account book so easily?

18:15.580 --> 18:16.630
Yes, Your Excellency.

18:16.650 --> 18:18.840
Without any twists and turns.

18:20.890 --> 18:23.250
We couldn't find anything wrong like this.

18:24.410 --> 18:25.630
Let's take it back

18:25.650 --> 18:27.740
and compare it with what's recorded in the Investigator's Office.

18:27.740 --> 18:28.600
Then we'll know if anything goes wrong.

18:28.620 --> 18:29.720
It'll be pretty soon.

18:29.740 --> 18:30.890
When we find Yan Bingyun

18:30.890 --> 18:31.890
and the birthday ceremony is held,

18:31.890 --> 18:33.110
we can go back.

18:33.130 --> 18:34.630
I don't think Shen Zhong

18:34.650 --> 18:36.600
would set him free easily.

18:36.740 --> 18:38.600
That's why I have to look for him myself.

18:40.860 --> 18:42.560
You couldn't find him.

18:45.620 --> 18:46.630
Actually,

18:46.650 --> 18:48.560
I've got an idea of how to find him.

18:48.980 --> 18:50.010
Your Excellency, did you find any clue

18:50.010 --> 18:51.480
in his former residence?

18:51.500 --> 18:52.720
No.

18:53.100 --> 18:55.320
It was cleaned out.

18:55.460 --> 18:57.080
But Shen Zhong doesn't know

18:57.100 --> 18:58.170
what I want to find

18:58.170 --> 19:00.360
is not in that house.

19:00.380 --> 19:01.680
What do you mean?

19:01.930 --> 19:03.130
The Embroidered Uniform Guards

19:03.130 --> 19:03.890
can empty a house,

19:03.890 --> 19:04.890
but they can't kill

19:04.890 --> 19:06.230
all residents in the street.

19:06.250 --> 19:07.410
I drank tea with some local people

19:07.410 --> 19:08.560
and chatted with them

19:08.580 --> 19:10.050
near that house today.

19:12.980 --> 19:15.770
Sir, why are you sighing in despair?

19:16.050 --> 19:17.750
I came here for my relative,

19:17.770 --> 19:19.150
but I was driven out.

19:19.170 --> 19:20.480
Really?

19:20.500 --> 19:22.170
Men's feelings are changeable.

19:22.170 --> 19:23.510
What will you do next?

19:23.530 --> 19:25.050
I don't know.

19:25.100 --> 19:26.340
I have to rent a house

19:26.340 --> 19:27.440
and settle down.

19:27.460 --> 19:29.030
I'm going to turn to a broker.

19:29.050 --> 19:30.560
You're lucky.

19:31.050 --> 19:33.410
It happens that house is available.

19:33.740 --> 19:35.080
Has it always been vacant?

19:35.170 --> 19:36.990
Nah. Someone once lived there.

19:37.010 --> 19:38.600
Something happened to him.

19:38.620 --> 19:39.720
Who lived there?

19:39.740 --> 19:40.560
What happened?

19:40.580 --> 19:41.960
A young man lived there.

19:41.980 --> 19:42.620
He associated with

19:42.620 --> 19:43.740
either high ranking officials

19:43.740 --> 19:45.410
or the rich.

19:45.770 --> 19:47.410
Later, a girl came to his house.

19:51.250 --> 19:52.220
After coming to Shangjing,

19:52.220 --> 19:53.220
Yan Bingyun asked others

19:53.220 --> 19:54.460
to call him Mr. Yun.

19:54.460 --> 19:55.870
It's said he spent money like water

19:55.890 --> 19:57.200
and made a lot of friends.

19:57.220 --> 19:59.050
There were lots of visitors.

19:59.580 --> 20:00.380
He just took the opportunity

20:00.380 --> 20:01.840
to collect military information.

20:01.860 --> 20:03.340
When he was arrested,

20:03.340 --> 20:05.170
it was some big guys dressed in plain clothes

20:05.170 --> 20:06.230
that took him away.

20:06.250 --> 20:07.770
They are secret agents of the Embroidered Uniform Guards.

20:07.890 --> 20:09.480
The common people like to watch the scene of bustle most.

20:09.500 --> 20:10.740
When he was taken away,

20:10.740 --> 20:12.150
lots of people watched from distance.

20:12.170 --> 20:13.340
Nowadays, this issue

20:13.340 --> 20:14.580
has become a topic of conversation.

20:14.580 --> 20:16.500
Did someone follow them all the way

20:16.500 --> 20:17.380
and happen to find

20:17.380 --> 20:18.290
where Yan Bingyun was imprisoned?

20:18.290 --> 20:19.510
Of course not.

20:19.530 --> 20:21.320
They're not that curious.

20:21.340 --> 20:23.390
Then what's the point of knowing this?

20:23.410 --> 20:24.750
It's said that

20:24.770 --> 20:26.230
he's romantic and wealthy.

20:26.250 --> 20:28.290
He also got to know a good girl.

20:30.050 --> 20:32.010
Is that all you found out?

20:32.340 --> 20:33.460
What's more,

20:33.460 --> 20:34.340
the same day when he was arrested,

20:34.340 --> 20:35.990
that girl came in advance

20:36.010 --> 20:37.410
to ask him to run away.

20:37.410 --> 20:39.010
When those big guys arrived,

20:39.010 --> 20:40.860
she became a weeping beauty

20:40.860 --> 20:42.990
beating and kicking them.

20:43.010 --> 20:44.100
But owing to their strength in numbers,

20:44.100 --> 20:45.960
Yan Bingyun was taken away, anyway.

20:46.460 --> 20:47.720
Songs and dramas

20:47.740 --> 20:49.440
are full of such stories.

20:49.530 --> 20:51.840
It's nobody but Yan Bingyun that was caught.

20:51.860 --> 20:53.630
It's nobody but the Embroidered Uniform Guards that caught him.

20:53.650 --> 20:54.410
How did that girl

20:54.410 --> 20:55.800
know about it before hand

20:55.820 --> 20:57.530
to ask him to run away?

20:58.860 --> 20:59.930
She beat and kicked the Embroidered Uniform Guards

20:59.930 --> 21:01.720
when they arrived.

21:01.740 --> 21:03.700
People turn pale even at the mention
of the Embroidered Uniform Guards.

21:03.700 --> 21:05.440
How did the girl dare do that?

21:05.460 --> 21:07.080
Why didn't those guys hit back?

21:07.250 --> 21:08.840
Something is wrong with that girl.

21:08.930 --> 21:10.130
Is there any young girl

21:10.130 --> 21:11.320
in the Embroidered Uniform Guards?

21:11.340 --> 21:12.770
Definitely not.

21:13.460 --> 21:14.680
Then it's weird.

21:14.700 --> 21:16.840
How did that girl know

21:16.860 --> 21:17.980
Yan Bingyun would be arrested that day?

21:17.980 --> 21:20.560
Why did those secret agents dare to do nothing to her?

21:23.650 --> 21:27.050
You must've got an answer.

21:28.820 --> 21:30.510
Does Shen Zhong have a daughter?

21:30.530 --> 21:31.390
No.

21:31.410 --> 21:33.050
He's not married.

21:33.290 --> 21:35.720
But he has a younger sister.

21:36.170 --> 21:37.600
How are they getting along with each other?

21:37.620 --> 21:39.320
Their parents died early.

21:39.340 --> 21:41.030
His sister is much younger than him.

21:41.050 --> 21:42.750
She was brought up by him.

21:42.770 --> 21:44.440
To his sister,

21:44.460 --> 21:46.250
he's an elder brother and a father.

21:46.530 --> 21:48.200
I want to see her.

21:49.580 --> 21:50.380
You're kept under close watch

21:50.380 --> 21:51.960
by the Embroidered Uniform Guards.

21:51.980 --> 21:53.390
Even if I let you go,

21:53.410 --> 21:55.410
you would be tailed after by them.

21:56.010 --> 21:58.080
You can reason things out.

21:58.100 --> 21:59.560
Reason things out?

22:07.620 --> 22:08.890
Your Excellency,

22:09.500 --> 22:11.200
Mr. He sent a message.

22:11.220 --> 22:12.360
He asked you to

22:12.380 --> 22:14.650
withdraw those secret agents around the mission.

22:15.050 --> 22:16.320
Why?

22:16.580 --> 22:17.960
He said

22:17.980 --> 22:19.530
the guy who stays with Fan Xian

22:19.530 --> 22:20.650
is called Wang Qinian

22:20.650 --> 22:22.440
and he's a tracking expert of Nanqing.

22:22.460 --> 22:23.620
Common secret agents

22:23.620 --> 22:25.600
are easily found out by him.

22:26.340 --> 22:28.130
That explains why Fan Xian

22:28.130 --> 22:30.080
shook them off during the day.

22:31.620 --> 22:32.410
Mr. He said

22:32.410 --> 22:33.620
we can withdraw those secret agents

22:33.620 --> 22:35.320
and he'll tail after them.

22:36.460 --> 22:37.890
Let them go out?

22:38.250 --> 22:39.600
Exactly.

22:39.930 --> 22:41.770
If there is anyone from the Investigator's Office

22:41.770 --> 22:42.960
who makes contact with Fan Xian,

22:42.980 --> 22:44.560
we can catch the whole lot in an action.

22:45.820 --> 22:47.680
Sounds reasonable.

22:47.740 --> 22:50.250
Shall I withdraw them?

22:51.820 --> 22:53.840
Check Wang Qinian out.

22:54.100 --> 22:55.560
If it's true,

22:56.170 --> 22:58.130
do as He Daoren said.

22:59.170 --> 23:00.440
Got it.

23:17.580 --> 23:18.770
Your Excellency.

23:22.010 --> 23:23.110
Is everything prepared?

23:23.130 --> 23:25.050
Which one do you mean?

23:25.170 --> 23:27.200
All messages about Beiqi

23:27.250 --> 23:28.600
sent by Yan Bingyun

23:28.620 --> 23:30.110
before he was arrested.

23:30.130 --> 23:31.170
Head Chen wants to present them

23:31.170 --> 23:32.080
to His Majesty.

23:32.100 --> 23:32.860
The sooner the better.

23:32.860 --> 23:34.170
Got it.

23:36.890 --> 23:39.200
Your Excellency, it's prepared.

23:47.820 --> 23:49.410
Have you got it?

23:52.930 --> 23:55.480
Yan Bingyun took advantage of Shen Zhong's younger sister

23:55.500 --> 23:57.030
to hide his real identity.

23:57.050 --> 23:58.680
Judging from the details,

23:58.700 --> 24:00.480
Shen Zhong's sister is well disposed

24:00.500 --> 24:01.870
towards Yan Bingyun.

24:01.890 --> 24:03.840
Do you have any information about her?

24:09.820 --> 24:15.170
I'm afraid it's not easy for Fan Xian

24:15.460 --> 24:17.870
to be as efficient and experienced as you.

24:17.890 --> 24:19.390
I'm old.

24:19.410 --> 24:20.960
Yeah,

24:21.220 --> 24:22.890
and you're more cunning.

24:25.700 --> 24:27.990
Shall we use a messenger pigeon

24:28.010 --> 24:29.440
to tell Fan Xian about it?

24:29.650 --> 24:31.770
No. It's too late.

24:32.890 --> 24:34.600
It seems that this girl

24:34.620 --> 24:36.390
is the only clue that can help

24:36.410 --> 24:38.890
Fan Xian find Yan Bingyun.

25:05.100 --> 25:07.440
That is Shen Zhong's younger sister.

25:08.220 --> 25:09.910
What will you do?

25:09.930 --> 25:11.170
Kidnap her?

25:12.580 --> 25:14.010
That's extreme.

25:40.620 --> 25:41.960
Won't you follow her?

25:43.130 --> 25:45.320
Wang Qinian is better at lightness skill.

26:35.290 --> 26:36.680
Your Excellency,

26:37.620 --> 26:39.250
the further south I went,

26:39.620 --> 26:41.360
the more heavily guarded it is.

26:41.380 --> 26:43.680
I'm afraid I'd be found out if I continue,

26:43.700 --> 26:45.480
so I came back.

26:45.500 --> 26:46.930
The south of the city?

26:48.460 --> 26:49.620
Did you see her get off?

26:49.620 --> 26:50.930
No.

26:52.010 --> 26:53.010
Do you think Lady Shen

26:53.010 --> 26:54.360
is going to see Yan Bingyun?

26:54.380 --> 26:55.680
It's hard to say.

26:56.220 --> 26:57.800
Just a guess.

26:57.820 --> 26:59.910
Even if it's true, the south of the city is too big

26:59.930 --> 27:01.440
to find him.

27:03.820 --> 27:05.130
I found that

27:05.770 --> 27:09.030
it's guarded loosely and then more closely.

27:09.050 --> 27:10.980
Something must've been hidden inside.

27:10.980 --> 27:12.230
I can't go in,

27:12.250 --> 27:13.630
so I looked around

27:13.650 --> 27:15.080
in the neighboring streets.

27:15.100 --> 27:16.840
I found that the guards

27:16.860 --> 27:18.410
mainly gather

27:18.580 --> 27:20.680
in these four to five streets.

27:24.130 --> 27:26.600
So, Yan Bingyun must've been

27:27.410 --> 27:29.560
imprisoned somewhere inside.

27:29.890 --> 27:31.200
Can you sneak in?

27:31.220 --> 27:33.480
No. There are too many secret agents.

27:34.290 --> 27:35.630
Once you show up,

27:35.650 --> 27:37.480
Shen Zhong would know about it at once.

27:37.500 --> 27:38.250
It's a large scope.

27:38.250 --> 27:40.200
He can transfer Yan Bingyun to somewhere else anytime.

27:40.220 --> 27:41.320
In the final analysis,

27:41.340 --> 27:42.840
only the two of you

27:42.860 --> 27:44.440
can't get it done.

27:44.580 --> 27:45.960
Besides,

27:46.250 --> 27:47.820
we're not sure if Lady Shen

27:47.820 --> 27:50.080
is going to Yan Bingyun.

27:50.930 --> 27:52.410
Let's keep waiting.

27:52.580 --> 27:54.930
Waiting for what? She's left.

27:55.650 --> 27:57.440
Let's wait for her to come back.

28:51.290 --> 28:52.650
She cried.

28:53.500 --> 28:55.560
There seems to be a blood stain on her sleeve.

28:55.740 --> 28:57.080
Seems?

28:57.650 --> 28:59.680
I can't see it clearly unless I get closer.

28:59.740 --> 29:01.440
Here is Shen Zhong's mansion.

29:01.460 --> 29:02.250
It's already risky

29:02.250 --> 29:03.960
to stay here.

29:04.170 --> 29:06.840
You'll be found out if you get closer.

29:07.220 --> 29:08.770
He's right.

29:09.010 --> 29:11.890
There are secret agents here.

29:33.500 --> 29:34.600
Let's go.

29:53.740 --> 29:55.560
Have a look at this.

29:56.250 --> 29:57.010
This is

29:57.010 --> 29:58.960
finished dosage formulation.

30:00.130 --> 30:01.530
And this.

30:02.620 --> 30:03.840
Take it home.

30:03.860 --> 30:05.250
Okay. Thank you.

30:11.340 --> 30:13.170
Knickknacks!

30:13.380 --> 30:15.290
Rattle-drums!

30:16.380 --> 30:18.200
Knickknacks!

30:19.010 --> 30:21.200
Bric-a-brac!

30:23.980 --> 30:25.740
Just some medicine for flesh wounds.

30:25.740 --> 30:27.530
There is also cold cure.

30:28.820 --> 30:30.480
I'm sixty percent sure it's Yan Bingyun.

30:30.500 --> 30:31.860
How about keeping waiting

30:31.860 --> 30:33.200
before making a decision?

30:34.410 --> 30:36.130
You don't have much time.

30:36.890 --> 30:37.870
Why not?

30:37.890 --> 30:39.750
Langtao is on the way to Shangjing.

30:39.770 --> 30:40.820
Who is Langtao?

30:40.820 --> 30:42.560
Ku He's first disciple.

30:43.250 --> 30:44.510
Haitang Duoduo's senior fellow apprentice?

30:44.530 --> 30:45.800
Right.

30:46.100 --> 30:48.440
He's more capable than Haitang.

30:48.460 --> 30:50.290
He also works for the Empress Dowager.

30:50.380 --> 30:51.480
Once he arrives,

30:51.500 --> 30:53.320
I'm afraid he'll take the place of me

30:53.340 --> 30:54.890
to keep watch on you.

30:55.580 --> 30:57.170
What to do?

30:59.380 --> 31:00.340
We're in the capital of Beiqi.

31:00.340 --> 31:01.890
It's enough to be sixty percent sure.

31:13.220 --> 31:14.200
Who are you?

31:14.220 --> 31:15.560
Tell Lady Shen

31:15.580 --> 31:16.720
to let the cart

31:16.740 --> 31:17.930
stop at the second crossroad tomorrow

31:17.930 --> 31:19.320
if she wants to save him.

31:19.340 --> 31:20.390
Who on earth are you?

31:20.410 --> 31:22.150
To save who? I don't understand.

31:22.170 --> 31:22.980
Lady Shen knows well

31:22.980 --> 31:23.990
what will happen to him

31:24.010 --> 31:25.840
if it's delayed.

31:27.500 --> 31:29.130
Wait!

32:14.100 --> 32:15.250
There she is.

32:21.340 --> 32:22.720
It doesn't stop.

32:26.770 --> 32:28.530
What a waste of effort!

32:36.130 --> 32:36.770
I'm going over.

32:36.770 --> 32:39.150
Your Excellency, it's risky.

32:39.170 --> 32:40.630
Time is not on our side.

32:40.650 --> 32:42.130
Do as I said.

32:44.530 --> 32:46.130
Be careful.

32:47.740 --> 32:48.890
Report to Shen Zhong

32:48.890 --> 32:50.650
as I told you.

33:20.920 --> 33:21.770
=Lady Shen, younger sister of Shen Zhong=

33:21.770 --> 33:22.240
=Lady Shen, younger sister of Shen Zhong=
Who are you?

33:22.240 --> 33:22.910
Who are you?

33:22.930 --> 33:24.290
Fan Xian.

33:25.620 --> 33:27.230
The envoy of Nanqing?

33:27.250 --> 33:28.600
Take me to see him.

33:28.620 --> 33:29.890
Who?

33:30.130 --> 33:31.030
I don't understand.

33:31.050 --> 33:32.460
If you really don't,

33:32.460 --> 33:34.200
you couldn't have stopped to wait for me.

33:38.410 --> 33:39.560
You have to help me.

33:39.580 --> 33:41.080
I want to save Yan Bingyun.

33:42.620 --> 33:43.500
Why do I have to help you?

33:43.500 --> 33:45.370
You're from Nanqing.

33:45.740 --> 33:47.250
He's seriously injured, right?

33:48.380 --> 33:51.320
I'm the only one who can save him.

33:53.130 --> 33:53.770
An agreement has been achieved

33:53.770 --> 33:55.030
between the two countries.

33:55.050 --> 33:56.680
Yan Bingyun will go back to Nanqing sooner or later.

33:56.700 --> 33:58.270
I just want to take him back a few days earlier.

33:58.290 --> 33:59.770
So, you are not betraying your country.

34:01.220 --> 34:02.340
Now that he'll be set free

34:02.340 --> 34:03.480
a few days later,

34:03.650 --> 34:05.030
why do I have to help you do it now?

34:05.050 --> 34:05.740
Before he leaves,

34:05.740 --> 34:07.340
the Embroidered Uniform Guards
is bound to torture him more severely.

34:07.340 --> 34:08.450
Do you really have the heart to

34:08.450 --> 34:09.760
see Yan Bingyun become disabled?

34:10.770 --> 34:12.400
He's a secret agent of the enemy.

34:12.420 --> 34:13.600
Why don't I have the heart?

34:13.620 --> 34:14.580
Then why did you buy

34:14.580 --> 34:15.890
the cold cure?

34:17.660 --> 34:19.040
And the food.

34:19.690 --> 34:21.210
You take food to him personally.

34:21.730 --> 34:23.730
It's prepared by you.

34:28.730 --> 34:30.410
If you don't believe me,

34:30.860 --> 34:32.520
you can drive me out.

34:33.900 --> 34:35.490
As long as you say it,

34:36.490 --> 34:38.240
I'll leave immediately.

34:42.380 --> 34:43.650
Your Excellency,

34:43.690 --> 34:46.370
Yan Bingyun has said nothing.

34:47.690 --> 34:49.450
Torture him more severely.

34:49.900 --> 34:51.800
Just make sure he's not dead.

34:51.820 --> 34:52.930
Got it.

34:53.180 --> 34:54.160
Oh. Your Excellency.

34:54.180 --> 34:55.250
Langtao

34:55.250 --> 34:56.970
is arriving in Shangjing soon.

34:59.420 --> 35:00.690
Once he arrives,

35:01.530 --> 35:02.510
we couldn't fail

35:02.530 --> 35:04.230
under any circumstances.

35:04.250 --> 35:05.520
Got it.

35:09.620 --> 35:12.800
Shouldn't you be tailing after Fan Xian?

35:12.820 --> 35:15.490
He and Wang Qinian are gone.

35:19.450 --> 35:20.510
What happened?

35:20.530 --> 35:21.950
They slipped out of the residence today

35:21.970 --> 35:23.160
and I tailed after them.

35:23.180 --> 35:25.100
Unexpectedly, someone stopped me halfway.

35:25.100 --> 35:25.770
Who is it?

35:25.770 --> 35:27.120
He wore a mask. I can't tell.

35:27.140 --> 35:28.100
He chased and fought me

35:28.100 --> 35:29.030
and then ran away.

35:29.050 --> 35:30.600
Fan Xian disappeared at that time.

35:35.620 --> 35:36.820
You're a Ninth Dan martial arts master.

35:36.820 --> 35:38.030
So is that guy.

35:38.050 --> 35:38.860
Which style?

35:38.860 --> 35:39.670
Not sure.

35:39.690 --> 35:40.730
On the whole,

35:40.730 --> 35:42.970
it's grand in scale and imposing.

35:43.660 --> 35:44.930
Mr. He,

35:44.970 --> 35:47.840
there are only a few Ninth Dan martial arts masters in Shangjing.

35:47.860 --> 35:49.880
How could it be possible?

35:49.900 --> 35:51.400
But he just appeared.

35:51.420 --> 35:53.040
Impossible!

35:53.530 --> 35:55.450
I don't think so.

35:56.210 --> 35:57.270
Your Excellency,

35:57.290 --> 35:58.010
there is no Ninth Dan martial arts master

35:58.010 --> 35:59.690
available in Shangjing.

36:00.050 --> 36:02.690
Shangshan Hu is also a Ninth Dan martial arts master.

36:03.210 --> 36:04.520
Grand General?

36:04.900 --> 36:05.940
These days,

36:05.940 --> 36:07.490
Shangshan Hu has been looking for Xiao En

36:07.490 --> 36:09.690
in public and in secret.

36:10.140 --> 36:11.560
To save Xiao En,

36:11.660 --> 36:14.490
he could cooperate with anyone.

36:15.820 --> 36:19.600
Fan Xian colluded with Grand General?

36:21.180 --> 36:22.940
Shangshan Hu's martial arts style

36:22.940 --> 36:25.160
is to be grand in scale.

36:25.180 --> 36:27.000
Do you think it is him?

36:27.530 --> 36:29.080
I can't tell.

36:31.340 --> 36:32.760
That's right.

36:33.290 --> 36:35.600
He won't give the show away easily.

36:39.010 --> 36:42.000
If he gets involved,

36:42.210 --> 36:43.950
things will be more complicated.

36:43.970 --> 36:44.920
Your Excellency,

36:44.940 --> 36:46.430
let me go to his mansion and ask him about it.

36:46.450 --> 36:47.800
Shut up!

36:50.100 --> 36:53.650
Be patient till we get hard evidence.

36:54.530 --> 36:55.650
Got it.

36:59.100 --> 37:00.840
I'm wondering

37:01.250 --> 37:03.320
where Fan Xian would go

37:03.820 --> 37:05.890
with his help.

37:21.900 --> 37:23.410
We're almost there.

37:23.530 --> 37:24.420
He's imprisoned

37:24.420 --> 37:25.990
in an old house in the south of the city.

37:26.010 --> 37:27.730
It was arranged by my brother.

37:27.860 --> 37:29.170
How is he doing?

37:30.050 --> 37:33.760
There are many wounds. And he caught a cold.

37:39.340 --> 37:40.400
Oh.

37:40.420 --> 37:41.670
What will you do?

37:41.690 --> 37:43.520
When will you save him?

37:44.820 --> 37:46.270
Just today.

37:46.290 --> 37:48.750
Today? Tonight?

37:48.770 --> 37:50.040
Now.

37:50.820 --> 37:52.170
No way.

37:52.210 --> 37:53.580
It's closely guarded.

37:53.580 --> 37:54.560
You couldn't go in.

37:54.580 --> 37:55.880
Tell them I'm your attendant.

37:55.900 --> 37:57.600
I'm here to carry things for you.

37:58.450 --> 38:00.380
They only allow me to go in alone.

38:00.380 --> 38:01.290
I can't even take my servant girl

38:01.290 --> 38:02.650
with me.

38:09.730 --> 38:10.990
We're almost there.

38:11.010 --> 38:12.400
You have to get off.

38:12.420 --> 38:14.210
Take more helpers here to save him.

38:15.010 --> 38:16.800
I don't have any other helper.

38:17.050 --> 38:18.840
How can you save him in this case?

38:19.820 --> 38:21.120
You have to help me.

38:21.140 --> 38:22.510
I can't.

38:22.530 --> 38:24.560
It's impossible to take you in.

38:24.580 --> 38:25.970
It's not you that take me in.

38:26.620 --> 38:28.240
It's me that take you in.

38:44.380 --> 38:45.890
Fan Xian!

38:47.660 --> 38:49.210
You all know me.

39:28.530 --> 39:30.000
A hostage?

39:30.100 --> 39:32.520
He's a formidable foe. How can you hold back?

39:32.770 --> 39:34.600
You should've taken action at once.

39:35.660 --> 39:36.970
Just ask him if he needs

39:36.970 --> 39:38.160
your help.

39:38.180 --> 39:39.800
Even if he's suspicious of you,

39:39.820 --> 39:42.370
your offer will remove his doubts.

39:42.860 --> 39:44.940
In that case, with eyes watching,

39:44.940 --> 39:46.340
I can't give you a chance to run away.

39:46.340 --> 39:47.920
He won't let you go with him.

39:47.940 --> 39:49.210
Why not?

39:50.770 --> 39:51.860
Whose cart is it

39:51.860 --> 39:52.770
that the secret agents

39:52.770 --> 39:53.750
let go so easily?

39:53.770 --> 39:55.040
It's really...

40:01.690 --> 40:03.280
Your Excellency,

40:03.730 --> 40:07.240
the hostage is your sister.

40:07.450 --> 40:08.530
We've already...

40:10.180 --> 40:11.430
Do you need me to go with you?

40:11.450 --> 40:12.840
Just stay and take care of things here.

40:12.860 --> 40:13.990
I'll get it done.

40:14.010 --> 40:16.040
Your Excellency!

40:32.100 --> 40:34.600
Don't come in. Stay outside.

40:44.770 --> 40:46.290
Lady Shen did a good job.

40:46.290 --> 40:47.800
She has a talent for playacting.

40:48.250 --> 40:50.000
Yan Bingyun.

40:51.490 --> 40:53.030
I'm Fan Xian.

40:53.050 --> 40:54.160
You stopped me

40:54.180 --> 40:55.190
on my way to the capital city from Danzhou.

40:55.210 --> 40:56.340
Do you still remember?

40:56.360 --> 40:58.670
=Yan Bingyun, member of the Fourth Division
of the Investigator's Office of Nanqing=

40:58.690 --> 41:00.130
Yes.

41:01.250 --> 41:03.400
Give me the token for Director-General.

41:03.420 --> 41:05.170
So you want to take it by force?

41:05.580 --> 41:06.890
Give it to me!

41:10.820 --> 41:12.080
It's a new wound.

41:12.100 --> 41:13.560
Did they just torture you?

41:15.420 --> 41:16.450
Thanks to your intelligence,

41:16.450 --> 41:17.670
Nanqing gained a complete victory.

41:17.690 --> 41:18.950
Beiqi sued for peace.

41:18.970 --> 41:20.580
As the envoy of the mission,

41:20.580 --> 41:22.490
I'm here to take you home.

41:22.690 --> 41:24.650
You gave in to Beiqi?

41:26.290 --> 41:28.000
Do you think I'm lying?

41:29.620 --> 41:31.560
It's not a long time since you went to the capital city.

41:31.660 --> 41:33.470
How could you become the envoy?

41:33.490 --> 41:35.030
He's telling the truth.

41:35.050 --> 41:36.560
He's here to save you.

41:37.660 --> 41:39.240
Now that he's the envoy,

41:39.340 --> 41:41.490
why did he come in by kidnapping you?

41:41.490 --> 41:43.600
Shen Zhong wouldn't set you free.

41:43.620 --> 41:45.760
So you came here yourself?

41:45.900 --> 41:47.890
Shen Zhong is crafty.

41:48.180 --> 41:50.270
How could he let you find me easily?

41:50.290 --> 41:51.210
Come on.

41:51.210 --> 41:52.930
I'm not stupider than him.

41:54.420 --> 41:57.760
The spy network of Nanqing is hidden.

41:57.970 --> 41:59.230
You plan to gain my trust

41:59.250 --> 42:00.840
by saving me

42:01.250 --> 42:01.940
and then catch the whole lot in an action

42:01.940 --> 42:03.250
when I contact them

42:03.250 --> 42:05.000
after going out.

42:05.340 --> 42:07.800
Shen Zhong wants you to do that, right?

42:09.180 --> 42:11.270
Are you suffering from persecution mania?

42:11.290 --> 42:12.670
I've never heard of that.

42:12.690 --> 42:13.880
As for how I got promoted

42:13.900 --> 42:15.320
and how I became the envoy,

42:15.340 --> 42:16.800
I'll explain it to you

42:16.820 --> 42:18.560
when we go back.

42:21.490 --> 42:22.880
Even if you're telling the truth,

42:22.900 --> 42:24.230
tell me

42:24.250 --> 42:25.800
how you'll get out of here.

42:25.900 --> 42:26.970
Shen Zhong wouldn't

42:26.970 --> 42:28.970
let me go easily.

42:29.050 --> 42:31.410
I have a subordinate called Wang Qinian.

42:31.900 --> 42:33.410
Wang Qinian?

42:34.250 --> 42:35.560
The clerk of the First Division?

42:35.580 --> 42:36.290
He's already

42:36.290 --> 42:37.930
chosen to work for me.

42:38.140 --> 42:38.690
Before I came here,

42:38.690 --> 42:40.690
I asked him to seek help.

42:41.940 --> 42:44.120
It's more ridiculous.

42:44.140 --> 42:45.990
Here is Beiqi.

42:46.010 --> 42:47.650
Who can you turn to?

43:10.960 --> 43:14.540
In the river of history,

43:14.560 --> 43:18.030
time goes round and round.

43:20.840 --> 43:24.180
Memories about the former and present lives

43:24.200 --> 43:28.270
join each other in an endless way.

43:30.160 --> 43:32.780
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:32.800 --> 43:35.040
one season follows another in a flash,

43:35.040 --> 43:37.540
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:37.560 --> 43:39.160
I just can't give up

43:39.160 --> 43:42.500
to be with you for my whole life.

43:42.520 --> 43:47.990
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:49.240 --> 43:51.790
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:52.080 --> 43:54.120
Year after year in the wandering,

43:54.120 --> 43:56.780
I count the remaining years.

43:56.800 --> 43:58.980
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:59.000 --> 44:00.990
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:01.280 --> 44:03.670
I never feel regretful.

44:03.720 --> 44:05.080
In such a chaotic world,

44:05.080 --> 44:08.060
I still miss you as ever.

44:08.080 --> 44:11.030
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:11.320 --> 44:13.380
With a gentle heart,

44:13.400 --> 44:16.060
I cherish our remaining years.

44:16.080 --> 44:17.600
Even though we have to go through

44:17.600 --> 44:20.110
all the hardships along the journey,

44:20.240 --> 44:27.430
you always stay by my side,

44:27.520 --> 44:30.190
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:30.480 --> 44:32.560
Year after year in the wandering,

44:32.560 --> 44:35.220
I count the remaining years.

44:35.240 --> 44:37.380
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:37.400 --> 44:39.630
even though we end up the destiny,

44:39.840 --> 44:42.020
I never feel regretful.

44:42.040 --> 44:43.440
In such a chaotic world,

44:43.440 --> 44:46.500
I still miss you as ever.

44:46.520 --> 44:49.630
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:49.720 --> 44:51.860
With a gentle heart,

44:51.880 --> 44:54.580
I cherish our remaining years.

44:54.600 --> 44:56.040
Even though we have to go through

44:56.040 --> 44:58.700
all the hardships along the journey,

44:58.720 --> 45:07.480
you always stay by my side.
